    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Empower Your Intent</i> is an atmospheric\u00a0rhythm game that helps build mindfulness and intentionality while consuming entertaining software.\u00a0Researched and designed to enhance your mental state while avoiding addictive patterns. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mesmerizing projectiles are choreographed to the rhythms and melodies of the music. Focus the timing and direction of your sparks to burst the projectiles into an eruption of flower petals.\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potential Uses:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healthier alternative to ease cravings for highly-addictive software like social-media and other games.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ritual to boost motivation and productivity before starting a bout of focused work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax: in general or to prepare for sleep.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energize and train reflexes/ coordination.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce gaming to those seeking to train new skills. (Has accessibility features so that people with no prior gaming experience can enjoy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obviously you can just use it to have fun and enjoy the music too :p</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Empower Your Intent</i> is an atmospheric\u00a0rhythm game that helps build mindfulness and intentionality while consuming entertaining software.\u00a0Researched and designed to enhance your mental state while avoiding addictive patterns. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mesmerizing projectiles are choreographed to the rhythms and melodies of the music. Focus the timing and direction of your sparks to burst the projectiles into an eruption of flower petals.\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potential Uses:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healthier alternative to ease cravings for highly-addictive software like social-media and other games.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ritual to boost motivation and productivity before starting a bout of focused work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax: in general or to prepare for sleep.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energize and train reflexes/ coordination.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce gaming to those seeking to train new skills. (Has accessibility features so that people with no prior gaming experience can enjoy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obviously you can just use it to have fun and enjoy the music too :p</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
